  "entity_raw": {
    "name_raw": "Consumption",
    "definition_type_raw": "Blood Hex",
    "source_book_raw": "Magic Tactics Toolbox pg. 29",
    "definition_raw": "Source Magic Tactics Toolbox pg. 29\nYou cause your rivals to spend additional precious resources while wounded.\n\nPrerequisites: Int 13, Use Magic Device 5 ranks.\n\nBenefit: As a full-round action, you can curse a creature you’ve dealt damage to since the beginning of your last round to use certain powers quickly. The creature must succeed at a Fortitude save or if it uses any of the following class abilities during the next minute, it must spend at least two daily uses or rounds of that ability: arcane poolUM, arcane reservoirACG, bardic performance, bloodrageACG, bombAPG, inspirationACG, ki pool, mental focusOA, mesmerist trickOA, phrenic poolOA, rage, or raging songACG.\n\nSpecial: A shaman or witch can use this blood hex as a standard action.",
    "links_raw": [
      {
        "anchor_text_raw": "Magic Tactics Toolbox pg. 29",
        "href_raw": "http://paizo.com/products/btpy9l2u?Pathfinder-Player-Companion-Magic-Tactics-Toolbox\n",
